    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall— (I) not be treated as income for the purposes of any other Federal or federally assisted program that bases eligibility for, or the amount of benefits on, need"
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): any other value or program
    IF `the value or amount is of dependent care services provided or arranged under clause (ii), or a payment or reimbursement under clause (i)` AND `the other program is a Federal or federally assisted program that bases eligibility for, or the amount of benefits on, need` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:657 | (iii) The value of any dependent care services provided for or arranged under clause (ii), or any amount received as a payment or reimbursement under clause (i), shall—
