-- src:683 | (v) Limitation on reporting requirements.—
-- src:684 | In carrying out this subparagraph, the Secretary and each applicable State agency shall limit the reporting requirements of a workforce partnership to—
-- src:685 | (I) on notification that an individual is receiving supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits, notifying the applicable State agency that the individual is participating in the workforce partnership;
-- src:686 | (II) identifying participants who have completed or are no longer participating in the workforce partnership;
-- src:687 | (III) identifying changes to the workforce partnership that result in the workforce partnership no longer meeting the certification requirements of the Secretary or the State agency under subparagraph (B)(ii)(I)(bb); and
-- src:688 | (IV) providing sufficient information, on request by the State agency, for the State agency to verify that a participant is fulfilling any applicable work requirements under this subsection or subsection (o).
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2015(d)(4)(N)(v) (src:683-688)
