§ `Section 2015(d)(4)(O): referral of certain individuals`

DECLARE `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i) step` IS ONE OF
    `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i)(I) refer the individual to an appropriate employment and training program component`
    `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i)(II) refer the individual to an appropriate workforce partnership, if available`
    `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i)(III) reassess the physical and mental fitness of the individual under paragraph (1)(A)`
    `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i)(IV) coordinate with other Federal, State, or local workforce or assistance programs to identify work opportunities or assistance`
    `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i) another step`

-- src:690 | (i) In general.—
-- src:691 | In accordance with such regulations as may be issued by the Secretary, with respect to any individual who is not eligible for an exemption under paragraph (2) and who is determined by the operator of an employment and training program component to be ill-suited to participate in that employment and training program component, the State agency shall—
-- src:692 | (I) refer the individual to an appropriate employment and training program component;
-- src:693 | (II) refer the individual to an appropriate workforce partnership, if available;
-- src:694 | (III) reassess the physical and mental fitness of the individual under paragraph (1)(A); or
-- src:695 | (IV) to the maximum extent practicable, coordinate with other Federal, State, or local workforce or assistance programs to identify work opportunities or assistance for the individual.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2015(d)(4)(O)(i) (src:690-695)
GIVEN `the individual is not eligible for an exemption under paragraph (2)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the operator of an employment and training program component determined the individual to be ill-suited to participate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the step the State agency takes` IS A `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i) step`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i) the step is one the State agency is to take` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "with respect to any individual who is not eligible for an exemption under paragraph (2) and who is determined by the operator of an employment and training program component to be ill-suited"
        IF NOT (`the individual is not eligible for an exemption under paragraph (2)` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `the operator of an employment and training program component determined the individual to be ill-suited to participate`) THEN NOTHING
        -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the clause says the State agency "shall— (I) ... (II) ... (III) ...; or (IV)" and does not say another step is barred
        IF `the step the State agency takes` EQUALS `s 2015(d)(4)(O)(i) another step` THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:696 | (ii) Process.—
-- src:697 | In carrying out clause (i), the State agency shall ensure that an individual undergoing and complying with the process established under that clause shall not be found to have refused without good cause to participate in an employment and training program.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2015(d)(4)(O)(ii) (src:696-697)
GIVEN `the individual is undergoing and complying with the process established under clause (i)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2015(d)(4)(O)(ii) the individual is found to have refused without good cause to participate in an employment and training program` MEANS
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "an individual undergoing and complying with the process established under that clause shall not be found to have refused without good cause to participate in an employment and training program"
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the clause speaks only of "an individual undergoing and complying with the process established under that clause"
    IF `the individual is undergoing and complying with the process established under clause (i)` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING
